---
title: "Whole-book narration"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: going
    lg1: ended
    lg2: idle
    lg3: Breaks PaidOnce or WithinLimits in some cases
    lg4: Path to the PaidOnce or WithinLimits bug
  }
  class lg0 teal
  class lg1 tan
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Nothing going on
  s1: Nothing going on: the site restarted
  s2: Starting: reading which paragraphs are saved
  s3: Stopping: the paragraph being made finishes
  s4: Making paragraph 1: not paid for yet
  s5: Stopped, as you asked
  s6: Making paragraph 1: paid for, the voice is reading it
  s7: Making paragraph 2: not paid for yet
  s8: Stopped by the monthly limit
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s2: you tick the cost box and press Create
  s1 --> s2: you tick the cost box and press Create
  s2 --> s1: the site restarts
  s2 --> s3: you press Stop
  s2 --> s4: the run reads which paragraphs are saved
  s3 --> s1: the site restarts
  s3 --> s5: the run reads which paragraphs are saved or the paragraph is saved
  s4 --> s1: the site restarts
  s4 --> s3: you press Stop
  s4 --> s4: the paragraph is not saved yet
  s4 --> s6: a paragraph is paid for
  s5 --> s2: you tick the cost box and press Create
  s6 --> s1: the site restarts
  s6 --> s3: you press Stop
  s6 --> s7: the paragraph is saved
  s7 --> s1: the site restarts
  s7 --> s3: you press Stop
  s7 --> s8: the monthly limit is reached
  s2 --> s7: the run reads which paragraphs are saved
  s8 --> s2: you tick the cost box and press Create
  s3 --> s8: the monthly limit is reached
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 mayBreak
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 mayBreak
  class s4 teal
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 tan
  class s5 mayBreak
  class s6 teal
  class s6 mayBreak
  class s6 bugPath
  class s7 teal
  class s7 mayBreak
  class s8 tan
  class s8 mayBreak
